    "content": "\n      <div class=\"definition-box\" style=\"background: var(--color-primary-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; color: var(--color-primary);\">Free Neural English Voice Generator Studio</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">\n          <strong>TextToSpeechH AI</strong> provides high-definition English text-to-speech synthesis using advanced deep neural networks. Generate natural, human-like voiceovers for YouTube videos, podcasts, e-learning courses, and audiobook narration with zero subscription fees.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Whether you are narrating YouTube videos, producing a podcast, or building an e-learning course, the voice carrying your words matters as much as the words themselves. A flat, robotic voice loses listeners in seconds. A natural one keeps them until the very end.</p>\n\n      <p style=\"line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 26px;\">TextToSpeechH AI gives you studio-grade English voices like Jenny, Guy, Aria, and Sonia, completely free. Paste your script, pick a voice, and download your MP3. No signup, no trial countdown, no watermark.</p>\n\n      <h2>Key Features of English Neural Text to Speech</h2>\n      <ul style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li><strong>Diverse Accent Options:</strong> Select from US (en-US-JennyNeural, en-US-GuyNeural), UK (en-GB-SoniaNeural), Australian, and Indian English accents.</li>\n        <li><strong>Commercial Licensing Rights:</strong> Download high-bitrate MP3 audio files with 100% royalty-free commercial usage rights for YouTube monetization and podcast distribution.</li>\n        <li><strong>Long Document & PDF Parsing:</strong> Drag and drop PDF, DOCX, or TXT manuscripts up to 10,000 words for batch audio rendering.</li>\n        <li><strong>Emotion & Speed Pitch Control:</strong> Fine-tune speaking pace, pitch, and voice style to suit educational tutorials, energetic ads, or calm storytelling.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Popular English Neural Voice Profiles</h2>\n      <div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr style=\"background: var(--color-bg-secondary); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);\">\n              <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Voice Name</th>\n              <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Accent / Locale</th>\n              <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Gender & Tone</th>\n              <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Best Use Case</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\">\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\"><code>en-US-JennyNeural</code></td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">American English</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Female, Warm & Conversational</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">YouTube Narrations & Podcasts</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\">\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\"><code>en-US-GuyNeural</code></td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">American English</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Male, Professional & Deep</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Documentaries & Corporate Training</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\">\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\"><code>en-GB-SoniaNeural</code></td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">British English</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Female, Elegant & Clear</td>\n              <td style=\"padding: 10px;\">Audiobooks & E-Learning Modules</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>How to Convert English Text to Audio MP3</h2>\n      <ol style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>Paste your raw script into the online text editor box above.</li>\n        <li>Select your preferred English voice model (e.g., Jenny, Guy, or Sonia).</li>\n        <li>Click <strong>Generate Audio</strong> to synthesize your speech instantly.</li>\n        <li>Download your studio-grade MP3 file to your device with one click.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Is TextToSpeechH AI 100% free for English voice generation?</h3>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;\">Yes, TextToSpeechH AI provides free text-to-speech conversion without hidden subscription charges, credit card requirements, or daily limits.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Can I use the generated MP3 files on YouTube and social media?</h3>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;\">Absolutely. All generated audio tracks are royalty-free and ready for YouTube monetization, TikTok videos, podcasts, and commercial advertising.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"primary-btn\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">Launch Free English Voice Generator →</a>\n      </div>\n    "
